About the demonstration corpus

All demonstration items are public, author-created, de-risked, and
non-operational. They are not a safety benchmark. They are not designed
to estimate model safety, policy compliance, evaluator accuracy, or the
prevalence of protocol sensitivity.

Results on this corpus do not establish real-world model safety, policy
compliance, evaluator error, or deployment suitability.